-- 1109: Blog post — "Microsoft Endpoint Administrator (MD-102) Certification in Singapore: WSQ Funding and Free Practice Exams"
--      Lead-magnet post for the WSQ MD-102 course (TGS-2024042603): why the certification
--      matters, WSQ/SkillsFuture funding breakdown, and the free MD-102 practice exam on
--      exams.tertiaryinfotech.com as the lead magnet. Backdated to 2025-11-14 (published,
--      status 1, no LinkedIn/Facebook share) per admin request.
